{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">RELEASE EXTERNAL statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310485","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">RELEASE EXTERNAL statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Frees (that is, unloads from memory) a dynamic\nlink library (DLL) or UNIX shared library.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement__syntax_GC1A14U2702153\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d207770e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement__idGDO2V82675673\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>RELEASE EXTERNAL <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> PROCEDURE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> &quot;<var class=\"keyword varname\">dll-name</var>&quot;</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> PROCEDURE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An optional &quot;noise&quot; keyword that does not affect the statement&#39;s behavior\nin any way.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">dll-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A character string representing the name of the DLL or UNIX shared\nlibrary.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement__example_GC1A14W2702163\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d207770e165\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">To\nfree the DLL, <span class=\"ph filepath\">mystuff.dll</span>, code the following\nstatement:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement__idGDO2V92675681\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>RELEASE EXTERNAL PROCEDURE &quot;mystuff.dll&quot;.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RELEASE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RELEASE-statement.html\">RELEASE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RELEASE-OBJECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RELEASE-OBJECT-statement.html\">RELEASE OBJECT statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310485","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"RELEASE EXTERNAL statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RELEASE-EXTERNAL-statement.html","type":"Manual"}